{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "SyncDance AI — singing-service",
    "description": "Microservicio **stateless** de análisis de canto de SyncDance AI. Recibe un audio (`absolute`) o un audio + referencia (`comparative`) y devuelve pitch, métricas, segmentos y feedback. Sin autenticación: solo red interna de Docker (decisión del equipo). Contrato detallado para el Core: `docs/celery-contract.md`.",
    "contact": {
      "name": "SyncDance AI — Equipo 7"
    },
    "license": {
      "name": "Uso interno — SyncDance AI"
    },
    "version": "0.3.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/analyze": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Análisis"
        ],
        "summary": "Analizar audio de canto",
        "description": "Analiza un audio de canto y devuelve métricas de pitch, segmentos y feedback.\n\n**Modos:**\n- `absolute` (default): análisis sin referencia; `pitch_accuracy` y\n  `average_cent_deviation` son `null`.\n- `comparative`: compara contra `reference_audio` (o `reference_notes`); requiere\n  referencia.\n\n**Formatos:** wav, m4a, mp3, aac, ogg. **Límites:** 50 MB, 600 s.\n\n**Ritmo (HU-S1-01):** `tempo_bpm` opcional (BPM esperado); si se envía,\n`metrics.tempo_deviation_bpm` mide la desviación y `rhythm_accuracy` la incorpora.\n`include_contour` sigue siendo futuro (Sprint 1).\n\n**Respuesta:** `202 Accepted` (no 200) con `{analysis_id, status, mode}`; el\nresultado completo se consulta en `GET /api/v1/analyze/{analysis_id}`.\n\n**Ejemplo curl:**\n```bash\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/analyze \\\n  -F \"audio=@test.wav\" \\\n  -F \"attempt_id=attempt-123\" \\\n  -F \"routine_id=routine-9\" \\\n  -F \"mode=absolute\"\n```",
        "operationId": "analyze_api_v1_analyze_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_analyze_api_v1_analyze_post"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "Análisis aceptado; consultar el GET del resultado",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AcceptedResponse"
                },
                "example": {
                  "analysis_id": "8386a02e0cc8495a8d63523b3fc86b19",
                  "status": "completed",
                  "mode": "absolute"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Audio o referencia inválidos",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "detail": {
                    "code": "INVALID_AUDIO",
                    "message": "No se pudo decodificar el audio",
                    "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "Excede los límites de tamaño o duración",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "detail": {
                    "code": "AUDIO_TOO_LARGE",
                    "message": "Archivo mayor al límite de 50 MB",
                    "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "`mode` inválido o campo obligatorio faltante",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "detail": {
                    "code": "INVALID_MODE",
                    "message": "mode debe ser 'absolute' o 'comparative'",
                    "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Servicio saturado (semáforo de análisis)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "detail": {
                    "code": "SERVICE_BUSY",
                    "message": "Servicio saturado de análisis; reintenta en unos segundos",
                    "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Falta FFmpeg en el entorno",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "detail": {
                    "code": "FFMPEG_NOT_FOUND",
                    "message": "FFmpeg no está disponible en el entorno",
                    "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "No aplica a este endpoint: el 503 lo devuelve `/health` cuando el servicio está degradado."
          },
          "504": {
            "description": "Timeout interno de pyin o de la alineación (HU-S1-05)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "detail": {
                    "code": "ANALYSIS_TIMEOUT",
                    "message": "El análisis excedió el timeout en la fase 'pyin'",
                    "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/analyze/{analysis_id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Análisis"
        ],
        "summary": "Obtener el resultado de un análisis",
        "description": "Devuelve el `AnalysisResult` completo de un análisis previo.\n\nIncluye `pitch` (curvas F0), `segments`, `scores`, `metrics`, `feedback` y\n`timings`. En `mode=absolute`, `pitch.reference`, `pitch_accuracy` y\n`average_cent_deviation` son `null`; `rhythm_accuracy` puede ser número si hay\nonsets (HU-S1-01).\n\nEl resultado vive en memoria con TTL de 1 h; si expiró, relanzar el `POST` con el\nmismo `attempt_id`.",
        "operationId": "get_analysis_api_v1_analyze__analysis_id__get",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "analysis_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "title": "Analysis Id"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Resultado del análisis",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AnalysisResult"
                },
                "example": {
                  "analysis_id": "8386a02e0cc8495a8d63523b3fc86b19",
                  "attempt_id": "attempt-123",
                  "routine_id": "routine-9",
                  "status": "completed",
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "algorithm_version": "0.5.0-hybrid-modes",
                  "duration_sec": 5.0,
                  "pitch": {
                    "student": [
                      {
                        "t": 0.0,
                        "f0": 439.8,
                        "voiced": true
                      }
                    ],
                    "hop_ms": 32
                  },
                  "segments": [],
                  "scores": {
                    "vocal": 99,
                    "afinacion": 100,
                    "estabilidad": 100,
                    "control_volumen": 97,
                    "ritmo": 94,
                    "silence_pct": 0
                  },
                  "metrics": {
                    "pitch_stability_cents": 0.0,
                    "mean_pitch_hz": 439.8,
                    "voiced_ratio": 1.0,
                    "rhythm_accuracy": 93.9,
                    "estimated_tempo_bpm": 117.2,
                    "onset_count": 10,
                    "onset_stability": 93.9
                  },
                  "feedback": [],
                  "timings": {
                    "preprocess_ms": 762,
                    "pitch_ms": 289,
                    "rhythm_ms": 31,
                    "dtw_ms": 0,
                    "scoring_ms": 8
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Análisis inexistente o expirado",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "detail": {
                    "code": "ANALYSIS_NOT_FOUND",
                    "message": "Análisis inexistente o expirado; relanza el POST /analyze",
                    "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Parámetro inválido"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Salud"
        ],
        "summary": "Liveness check con dependencias",
        "description": "Liveness: estado del servicio y de sus dependencias (ffmpeg, librosa, modelos y disco). Devuelve **503 `degraded`** si falta FFmpeg o librosa no carga. Para readiness usa `/ready`.",
        "operationId": "health_health_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Servicio sano",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {},
                "example": {
                  "status": "ok",
                  "service": "singing-service",
                  "version": "0.3.0",
                  "checks": {
                    "ffmpeg": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "version": "7.1.5"
                    },
                    "librosa": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "version": "1.0.0"
                    },
                    "models_loaded": {
                      "ok": true
                    },
                    "disk_space_mb": 952675,
                    "warmup": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "duration_ms": 2710.5
                    },
                    "rhythm_warmup": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "duration_ms": 10050.2
                    }
                  },
                  "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e",
                  "timestamp": "2026-11-14T19:07:53.272048+00:00"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Servicio degradado (falta FFmpeg o librosa no carga)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "status": "degraded",
                  "service": "singing-service",
                  "version": "0.3.0",
                  "checks": {
                    "ffmpeg": {
                      "ok": false
                    },
                    "librosa": {
                      "ok": true,
                      "version": "1.0.0"
                    },
                    "models_loaded": {
                      "ok": true
                    },
                    "disk_space_mb": 952675,
                    "warmup": {
                      "ok": false
                    },
                    "rhythm_warmup": {
                      "ok": false
                    }
                  },
                  "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e",
                  "timestamp": "2026-11-14T19:12:15.713759+00:00"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/ready": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Salud"
        ],
        "summary": "Readiness probe (K8s/Docker)",
        "description": "Readiness: indica si el servicio puede atender tráfico. **200** cuando está listo; **503** durante `warmup`, tras `shutting_down` o si `ffmpeg_unavailable`. Diferente de `/health` (liveness).",
        "operationId": "ready_ready_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Listo para atender",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {},
                "example": {
                  "ready": true,
                  "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "No listo (warmup, shutting_down o ffmpeg_unavailable)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "example": {
                  "ready": false,
                  "reason": "warmup",
                  "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/version": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Sistema"
        ],
        "summary": "Metadatos de versión y build",
        "description": "Versión del servicio, commit/build inyectados en la imagen (`GIT_SHA`, `BUILD_TIME`) y versiones de runtime (debug).",
        "operationId": "version_version_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Metadatos de versión",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "type": "object",
                  "title": "Response Version Version Get"
                },
                "example": {
                  "version": "0.3.0",
                  "git_sha": "abc1234",
                  "build_time": "2026-11-15T12:00:00Z",
                  "python": "3.14.6",
                  "ffmpeg": "7.1.5",
                  "fastapi": "0.142.2",
                  "librosa": "1.0.0",
                  "request_id": "7c1f0b2e9a4d4f6b8c3e5a1d2f4b6c8e"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/metrics": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Sistema"
        ],
        "summary": "Métricas Prometheus",
        "description": "Métricas del servicio en formato Prometheus (`text/plain; version=0.0.4`). Sin autenticación: red interna, consistente con `/health`. Incluye contadores de análisis, histogramas de latencia (total, pitch, alineación y ritmo), requests activos y timeouts internos.",
        "operationId": "metrics_metrics_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Métricas en formato Prometheus",
            "content": {
              "text/plain": {
                "example": "# HELP analysis_requests_total Análisis finalizados por modo y resultado\n# TYPE analysis_requests_total counter\nanalysis_requests_total{mode=\"absolute\",status=\"success\"} 1.0\n"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "AcceptedResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "analysis_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Analysis Id",
            "description": "Identificador del análisis encolado"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "queued",
              "completed",
              "failed"
            ],
            "title": "Status"
          },
          "mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "absolute",
              "comparative"
            ],
            "title": "Mode",
            "description": "Modo de análisis aplicado"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "analysis_id",
          "status",
          "mode"
        ],
        "title": "AcceptedResponse",
        "description": "Respuesta 202 del POST /api/v1/analyze."
      },
      "AnalysisResult": {
        "properties": {
          "analysis_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Analysis Id"
          },
          "attempt_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Attempt Id"
          },
          "routine_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Routine Id"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "queued",
              "completed",
              "failed"
            ],
            "title": "Status"
          },
          "mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "absolute",
              "comparative"
            ],
            "title": "Mode"
          },
          "algorithm_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Algorithm Version",
            "description": "Versión del algoritmo que produjo el resultado"
          },
          "duration_sec": {
            "type": "number",
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0.0,
            "title": "Duration Sec"
          },
          "pitch": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PitchCurves"
          },
          "pitch_contour": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PitchContour"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Curva F0 downsampleada a ~10 Hz (HU-S1-09); null si include_contour=false o ausente"
          },
          "segments": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Segment"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Segments"
          },
          "scores": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Scores"
          },
          "metrics": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Metrics"
          },
          "feedback": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FeedbackItem"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Feedback"
          },
          "timings": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timings"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "analysis_id",
          "attempt_id",
          "routine_id",
          "status",
          "mode",
          "algorithm_version",
          "duration_sec",
          "pitch",
          "segments",
          "scores",
          "metrics",
          "feedback",
          "timings"
        ],
        "title": "AnalysisResult",
        "description": "Resultado completo que el Core persiste en PostgreSQL (fuente de verdad)."
      },
      "Body_analyze_api_v1_analyze_post": {
        "properties": {
          "audio": {
            "type": "string",
            "contentMediaType": "application/octet-stream",
            "title": "Audio",
            "description": "Audio o video del intento"
          },
          "reference_audio": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "contentMediaType": "application/octet-stream"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Reference Audio",
            "description": "Audio de referencia (requerido en comparative)"
          },
          "reference_notes": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Reference Notes",
            "description": "Notas JSON de referencia: [{\"t\":0.0,\"f0\":440.0}, ...]"
          },
          "attempt_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Attempt Id",
            "description": "Intento en el Core (idempotencia)"
          },
          "routine_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Routine Id",
            "description": "Rutina a la que pertenece el intento"
          },
          "mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Mode",
            "description": "absolute (sin referencia) | comparative (requiere referencia)",
            "default": "absolute"
          },
          "tempo_bpm": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Tempo Bpm",
            "description": "Tempo esperado en BPM (opcional); habilita tempo_deviation_bpm"
          },
          "include_contour": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "title": "Include Contour",
            "description": "Incluir pitch_contour downsampleado a ~10 Hz (HU-S1-09)",
            "default": false
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "audio",
          "attempt_id",
          "routine_id"
        ],
        "title": "Body_analyze_api_v1_analyze_post"
      },
      "FeedbackItem": {
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Code",
            "description": "Código estable para i18n/trazabilidad"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Message",
            "description": "Mensaje en español (HU-46/RF-39)"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "message"
        ],
        "title": "FeedbackItem"
      },
      "Metrics": {
        "properties": {
          "pitch_stability_cents": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Pitch Stability Cents"
          },
          "mean_pitch_hz": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "exclusiveMinimum": 0.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Mean Pitch Hz"
          },
          "voiced_ratio": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "maximum": 1.0,
                "minimum": 0.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Voiced Ratio"
          },
          "pitch_accuracy": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "maximum": 100.0,
                "minimum": 0.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Pitch Accuracy"
          },
          "rhythm_accuracy": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "maximum": 100.0,
                "minimum": 0.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Rhythm Accuracy"
          },
          "estimated_tempo_bpm": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "exclusiveMinimum": 0.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Estimated Tempo Bpm"
          },
          "onset_count": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0.0,
            "title": "Onset Count",
            "default": 0
          },
          "onset_stability": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "maximum": 100.0,
                "minimum": 0.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Onset Stability"
          },
          "tempo_deviation_bpm": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Tempo Deviation Bpm"
          },
          "alignment_method": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "fastdtw",
              "time"
            ],
            "title": "Alignment Method",
            "description": "Método de alineación en comparative: fastdtw (HU-S1-04) o time (fallback); time también en absolute",
            "default": "time"
          },
          "average_cent_deviation": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number",
                "minimum": 0.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Average Cent Deviation"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "Metrics",
        "description": "Métricas del contrato híbrido (Sprint 0 + ritmo HU-S1-01).\n\n- `pitch_stability_cents`, `mean_pitch_hz`, `voiced_ratio`: en ambos modos.\n- `pitch_accuracy`, `average_cent_deviation`: sólo `mode=comparative` (null en absolute).\n- `rhythm_accuracy` y campos de ritmo: en ambos modos; null si no hay onsets."
      },
      "PitchContour": {
        "properties": {
          "student": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PitchContourPoint"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Student",
            "description": "Curva del alumno"
          },
          "reference": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PitchContourPoint"
                },
                "type": "array"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Reference",
            "description": "Curva de la referencia; null en mode=absolute"
          },
          "downsample_hz": {
